  "sourceSummary": "BNSSG NHS My Joint Health Hub Foot Doming: seated at edge of chair with feet flat; tense the foot arch without scrunching toes and maintain heel and forefoot contact. Source specifies5second hold; this8second illustration uses2second contraction,3second hold,2second release,1second rest.",
